WEBVTT

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:31.017
that she's working twice as hard
for half as much,

00:04:31.058 --> 00:04:36.147
but she has no idea
how much harder it is for her

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:38.649
than it is for the guy
in the Brooks Brothers jacket

00:04:38.649 --> 00:04:40.609
in the office across the hall.

00:04:40.651 --> 00:04:41.944
I know.

00:04:41.944 --> 00:04:43.404
I was that guy.

00:04:44.322 --> 00:04:46.949
And I thought I was one of the good guys.

00:04:46.991 --> 00:04:49.327
Sensitive to women,

00:04:49.327 --> 00:04:50.953
egalitarian.

00:04:51.662 --> 00:04:54.206
Then came the first time
I ever flew as a female.

00:04:54.874 --> 00:04:58.753
Now I've flown over 2.3 million miles
with American Airlines.

00:04:58.753 --> 00:05:00.796
I know my way around an airplane.